ons_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.21, Equations (13.56)–(13.59)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"599–600"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"623–624"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((J_i(J_jf))(x)\\leq0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((J_i(J_jf))(x)\\leq0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((J_i(J_jf))(x)\\geq0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((J_i(J_jf))(x)\\geq0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.21 陈述和 pp.599–600 证明已核对。必要性把两坐标 10、01 代入格不等式；充分性可等价表述为离散导数随其余坐标单调，沿 X\\Y、Y\\X 逐坐标求和得格不等式。同指标二阶导数恒为零，n=1 时条件自动成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbderivative]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-submodular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$J_i$（see [[27-df-pbderivative]]），$\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$J_i$（see [[27-df-pbderivative]]），$\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"J_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\for